00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:28.830
- [Narrator] This "Great Big Story"

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:31.200
is brought to you by Delta.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.820
When we venture out into the world,

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.030
we see all that we share.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.613
(gentle music)

00:00:39.542 --> 00:00:41.630
Shamali Sanjaya is an avid surfer

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:44.114
and president of the Arugam Bay Surf Club.

00:00:44.114 --> 00:00:46.532
- Stand up!
- On your board.

00:00:46.532 --> 00:00:48.539
(group cheers)

00:00:48.539 --> 00:00:50.400
(everyone laughs)

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.817
(Shamali speaks in foreign language)

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:03.310
(water splashes)

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:05.670
- [Narrator] In 2018, she formed the first

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:09.070
officially registered female
surf club in Sri Lanka,

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:10.920
but doing so wasn't easy.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:13.420
Many people believed the
local women should be at home,

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:14.913
not on the water.

00:01:16.064 --> 00:01:20.481
(Shamali speaks in foreign language)

